   "class": "sc-fa539dd8-3 bGsoaN text-content",
   "landmarks": [
    "aside",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 209,
   "text": "The token listed on CoinMarketCap as AINFT, formerly APENFT, is a TRON-native project that started around art NFTs and governance. It later expanded its positioning toward AI while keeping the same NFT ticker.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
