   "index": 37,
   "tag": "p",
   "class": "sc-fa539dd8-3 bGsoaN text-content",
   "landmarks": [
    "aside",
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 282,
   "text": "$NFT is still described as the ecosystem’s governance token, but the research does not show that holding the token is required to use the platform’s NFT or AI services. The AI direction is real, but the available evidence does not establish it as a major source of token demand yet.",
   "counts": {
